  excerpt: "How long you can stay in Vietnam: visa free days, the 90 day eVisa, longer stay routes, overstay risks and residence cards. Checked 27 October 2026.",
  metaTitle: "How Long Can You Stay in Vietnam? Visa Limits Guide",
  metaDescription: "How long you can stay in Vietnam: visa free days, the 90 day eVisa, longer stay routes, overstay risks and residence cards. Checked 27 October 2026.",
